13 億美元、微軟 (MSFT-US) 預計 1064 億美元、而 IBM (IBM-US) 預計 788 億美元。", "external_links": [], "published": "2018-01-23T03:17:00.000+02:00", "crawled": "2018-01-22T16:50:31.006+02:00", "highlightTitle": ""}